            "review_title": "Review at La Rosa Bistro - Cofffee & Pub",
            "review_text": "Rob Nesbit\nWarsaw, Poland6958 contributions\n2\nI hope to be back. Recommended!\nApr 2023 • Friends\nPassed and wasn't sure it was open, no real front entrance or door that was open.....\nWalked by later and seen it was open so ventured in by the side, we and another couple were the only two in the pub on a Saturday night. If it looks closed, you wont get many customers, tut tut.\n\nBut its a very classy place, absolutely great décor, all very classic and smart, with flowers everywhere... and a nice relaxing ambiance. Lots of space, and a great place to come with a loved one, as it has a very romantic setting. \n\nOrdered a draught lager, we both got ice cream, and also a plain cheesecake....all coming to about 11 Euros, which wasn't bad at all.\n\nLiked this place, and the menu looked great, a nice mix of traditional Vietnamese and standard western dishes......if its as good as the desserts we had I would love to try a main dish here in the future. I hope to be back. Recommended!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten April 29, 2023",
