            "review_text": "Xpatxplorer\nNew Delhi, India811 contributions\n0\nGenerous portions, well made food and great air conditioning !\nApr 2023 • Friends\nGenerous portions, diverse menuand great air conditioning. We had the chicken Fraser and shrimp salad and both were very good. The chicken was tender and juicy and the shrimps were well grilled and deliciou. We had asked for two chicken ceasera but they only had one. \nService was good and I quite liked the diverse menu and the choices it offered. While the restaurant has an upmarket feel the prices for the food are good while drinks seemed a bit more expensive. There’s also a kids play ground below. Will definitely go back.\nRead more\nWritten April 29, 2023",
